# API Changelog 2.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### GET /api/{domain}/{project}/badges/security-score
-  endpoint added


### GET /api/{domain}/{project}/install-command
-  endpoint added


### POST /register
-  endpoint added




## Components
-  the component security scheme `AccessToken` was added
-  the component security scheme `OAuth` was added
-  the component security scheme `bearerAuth` was added


## Security
-  the security scheme `bearerAuth` was added to the API




